  "sourceTitle": "Love Cakes Or Strawberry Muffins (Gluten-Free)",
  "sourceText": "Love Cakes Or Strawberry Muffins (Gluten-Free)\nBy: Gluten Free Goodness\nPublished: Thursday, February 25, 2010 - 1:50pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1/2 cup oat flour (gluten-free)\n1 cup tapioca flour\n2 teaspoons baking powder\n1 teaspoon salt\n1 teaspoon xanthan gum\n cup honey\n3 tablespoons olive oil\n1/2 cup orange juice\n2/3 cup buttermilk\n1 egg, beaten\n4 large strawberries, sliced thin\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Stir together all ingredients. 2 Pour batter into muffin molds. 3 Bake for 15-20 minutes at 350 degrees F.\n\nAbout\n\n\nThese muffins have been a staple in our house, ever since I was a child at home. They are delicious served fresh from the oven, with a dollop of butter.",
